Package: gofmetric
Title: Goodness-of-Fit Tests for Distributions on Metric Spaces
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Diego", "Serrano", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "dieserra@est-econ.uc3m.es")
Description: Implements Kolmogorov-Smirnov and Cramer-von Mises goodness-of-fit
    tests built from distance profiles on Euclidean, spherical, hyperbolic,
    compositional, and product spaces. Simple and composite null hypotheses
    are calibrated by multiplier bootstrap, with fast and re-estimated
    procedures where supported.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/dieseor/gofmetric
BugReports: https://github.com/dieseor/gofmetric/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.4.0)
Imports: Rcpp, stats, utils, parallel, movMF, sphunif, pracma, rotasym,
    mvtnorm, gbutils, CompQuadForm
Suggests: testthat, numDeriv
LinkingTo: Rcpp
NeedsCompilation: yes
Config/testthat/edition: 3
